    },
    {
      "id": "coordinate-geometry-01-011",
      "number": 11,
      "question": "The perimeter of a triangle with vertices (0, 4), (0, 0) and (3, 0) is:",
      "options": {
        "A": "5 units",
        "B": "12 units",
        "C": "11 units",
        "D": "7 units",
        "E": "None of the above"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "Side lengths are 4, 3, and sqrt(4^2 + 3^2) = 5. Perimeter = 4 + 3 + 5 = 12.",
      "hash": "3e6dca565eb808d1",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "शीर्षों (0, 4), (0, 0) और (3, 0) वाले त्रिभुज का परिमाप है:",
          "options": {
            "A": "5 इकाई",
            "B": "12 इकाई",
            "C": "11 इकाई",
            "D": "7 इकाई",
            "E": "उपर्युक्त में से कोई नहीं"
          },
          "explanation": "भुजाओं की लंबाई 4, 3 और sqrt(4^2 + 3^2) = 5 है। परिमाप = 4 + 3 + 5 = 12।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coordinate-geometry-01-012",
      "number": 12,
      "question": "The value of k for which the points (7, -2), (5, 1) and (3, k) are collinear is:",
      "options": {
        "A": "4",
        "B": "-4",
        "C": "2",
        "D": "0",
        "E": "More than one of the above"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "For collinearity, slopes must be equal: (1 - (-2))/(5-7) = (k-1)/(3-5) => 3/-2 = (k-1)/-2 => k-1 = 3 => k = 4.",
      "hash": "81c3fdbd2b910a2f",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "k का वह मान जिसके लिए बिंदु (7, -2), (5, 1) और (3, k) संरेख हैं, वह है:",
          "options": {
            "A": "4",
            "B": "-4",
            "C": "2",
            "D": "0",
            "E": "उपर्युक्त में से एक से अधिक"
          },
          "explanation": "संरेखता के लिए, ढाल समान होनी चाहिए: (1 - (-2))/(5-7) = (k-1)/(3-5) => 3/-2 = (k-1)/-2 => k-1 = 3 => k = 4।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coordinate-geometry-01-013",
      "number": 13,
      "question": "The ratio in which the y-axis divides the line segment joining (2, -3) and (5, 6) is:",
      "options": {
